      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Scotts Corners sits beside the 4,300‑acre Ward Pound Ridge Reservation, Westchester County’s largest park, offering hiking, skiing, and camping trails.",
